# Acorn's clients talk to backend-core's server: api.joinedhq.com/acorn/... in production
# builds, the local one (`bun run dev:core-api`, see backend-core/.env.example) in
# development builds. Copy this file to acorn/.env to override either at build time; the
# extension reads it. Rebuild (and reload the extension) after a change.
# Only VITE_* keys are bundled; anything else in this file stays out of the build.
# VITE_ACORN_API_URL=https://api.joinedhq.com
# VITE_JOINED_URL=https://joinedhq.com
